# route: level=w7_l1_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:4,letters:3
# The Beginner two-stream route of Shell Beach in co-op (designer D7; P1|P2, recorded from closed-loop duo
# macros, build/d7/bot_w7_l1_coop.gd). Club only, no S (belt invariance). Both cross every reach on one
# raft (P1 paddles, P2 guards; both paddle the rafts of reaches 2 and 3 out of their eddies); the blowholes
# one after the other, P1 fetches letter B; the Shellback of beach D by the pincer (P2 baits in front of it,
# P1 jumps over it and strikes its back); the fish pools; gate 'dune': P1 holds plate A (crouched), P2 walks
# the lower corridor to plate B, P1 climbs the coral shelves and passes the upper corridor; gate 'stack': P1
# curls on the rock, P2 lobs him onto the shoulder with a high strike (the ball unrolls the vine), P2 climbs
# it; both to the exit totem. No role stands 243 ticks without input (G33).
